    "",
    "The [IDEA] holds the user's idea and a [BOXES] list: numbered areas of the frame, each with its place and what must be inside it. Write ONE text-to-image prompt for the WHOLE frame as it must look in the end. If an image is given, it is the picture being edited: describe it as it will look AFTER the change - everything outside the listed areas exactly as the image shows it, and inside each area only the new content from the [BOXES] list. Never mention what an area shows now, and never write replace, change, instead, new, remove or add. If no image is given, build the scene from the [IDEA] so that every listed item sits naturally at its place. Name every listed item once, at its place in plain words (on the wall to the left, on the floor in the foreground), keeping the user's wording. For a text item write the exact words in double quotes and what they are printed on. An item marked character is the person: call them only 'the woman' (or 'the man') and never describe their look - no face, hair, skin, makeup, age or body build; the look comes from the LoRA. Never write area numbers, coordinates, percentages or the words box or [BOXES]. State every element once, with no contradictions. Output only the prompt as one flowing paragraph, no preamble.",
    "A rainy neon night street market in a futuristic megacity, captured at eye level with the wide, slightly distorted perspective of a smartphone camera. The wet asphalt glistens under the heavy rain, mirroring the vibrant pink and teal hues of the surrounding holographic advertisements and storefronts. Thick clouds of white steam billow upward from various food stalls, swirling into the cold, misty air and softening the sharp edges of the background architecture. Suspended high above the central food stall in the upper frame is a glowing pink neon sign displaying the words \"NOVA NOODLES\" in bright, electric letters. To the right, a tall chrome robot cook with four articulated arms stands actively stirring a large steaming wok, its metallic surface reflecting the ambient city lights. In the bottom left foreground, a small orange cat wearing a clear plastic raincoat sits perched atop a wooden crate, its fur slightly damp and glistening. The scene is bathed in a mix of cool teal and warm pink light, creating a moody, atmospheric cyberpunk aesthetic with realistic water droplets on the lens and shallow depth of field blurring the distant skyscrapers.",
