   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "HOW IT WORKS\nEDIT a picture: Load Image ON. Draw boxes over the parts to change; in each box write what must be there (text box = the exact words). Only the boxes are redrawn, everything else stays pixel-identical.\nGENERATE: bypass Load Image (Ctrl+B). Set width/height on the canvas, draw where each thing goes.\nbrief = your idea for the whole frame. The canvas sends brief + the box list to the prompter, the prompter writes the full prompt, the sampler draws it.\nPrompter OFF (llm_enabled = false): type the whole prompt yourself into the prompter's final_prompt - in edit mode describe the frame AFTER the change.\ncharacter_boxes: numbers of boxes that hold your LoRA character (e.g. 2) - the prompter will not describe their look.\nSeam visible? raise feather. New thing too weak? keep start_step 0."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "HOW IT WORKS\nEDIT a picture: Load Image ON. Draw boxes over the parts to change; in each box write what must be there (text box = the exact words). Only the boxes are redrawn, everything else stays pixel-identical.\nGENERATE: bypass Load Image (Ctrl+B). Set width/height on the canvas, draw where each thing goes.\nbrief = your idea for the whole frame. The canvas sends brief + the box list to the prompter, the prompter writes the full prompt, the sampler draws it.\nPrompter OFF (llm_enabled = false): type the whole prompt yourself into the prompter's final_prompt - in edit mode describe the frame AFTER the change.\ncharacter_boxes: numbers of boxes that hold your LoRA character (e.g. 2) - the prompter will not describe their look.\nSeam visible? raise feather. New thing too weak? keep start_step 0."
   },
